Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Owie! Where'd it go? Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These bones kind of look like\Nthey belong to that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This coin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be the incredible\Ntreasure Hulemy was talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.28,0:00:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might as well take it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.82,0:00:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.73,0:00:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this that stratum split thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.84,0:00:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.90,0:00:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, someone with the\Nblessing of might, save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you don't have to have a blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take anyone strong enough to\Ncarry around a vending machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:01:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a lie in my heart, and the\Nsky is bright. The sky is bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.74,0:01:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the time that the wind is passing\Nthrough, and the drama is moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.76,0:01:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to die.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.22,0:01:22.56,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine, {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.80,0:01:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody, everybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.06,0:01:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.57,0:02:26.45,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(98,55)\fad(734,1)\fscx87}The Voracious Devils
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.54,0:02:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me think here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.68,0:02:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll turn into a balloon vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.24,0:02:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They could commonly be seen in\Nsupermarkets and amusement parks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.16,0:02:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it so slow?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, there's gotta be a\Nway to blow these up faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.50,0:02:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe there's a stat I\Ncan boost to speed it up?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.59,0:02:46.06,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (left column; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\frz-4.73\fax0.08\an7\pos(90,106)\frx354\fs40\fsp6\bord0\fad(280,1)\blur20\t(1,280,\blur0)}Attack
