Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.59,0:02:46.06,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (right column; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an7\frz4.55\pos(470,299)\bord0\frx354\fax-0.08\fs30\fsp6\blur20\t(1,280,\blur0)}Luck
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.30,0:02:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like to spend 10,000\Npoints to increase your speed by 10?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:03:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this didn't help me even a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.14,0:03:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.28,0:03:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a cardboard vending machine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.96,0:03:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand shaped from the finest cardboard,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these used to be popular\Nwith grade school students.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.92,0:03:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hulemy mentioned something\Nabout this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.26,0:03:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said there was an enormous labyrinth\Nunderneath the Clear Flow Lake stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks super complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take some pictures with my\Nsecurity camera just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can put them together to\Nget an idea of the layout.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a 10 out of 10 landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.72,0:03:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.84,0:03:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, that's the coin the\Neight-legged crocodile dropped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to pick it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.86,0:04:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I could use some points to\Nunlock a function that'll let me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, does that say a million?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I have so many points?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, I beat that big monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.18,0:04:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.72,0:04:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, you'd earn points\Nby defeating enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.80,0:04:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I'd say I got lucky because\Neverything just kinda worked out. I'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sure how good of a hunter I'd be so it's\Nprobably best if I continue selling my
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wares anyway what kind of stuff can I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unlock with my million\Npoints I can feel it
