Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.14,0:04:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.50,0:04:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as it adheres to the basic\Ndefinition of a vending machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can transform into a\Nwhole bunch of new things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.01,0:04:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we give it a spin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a coin-operated vacuum cleaner now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.32,0:05:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kind you'd see in a\Nself-service car wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.84,0:05:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to suck.
