Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The eight-legged crocodile coin,\Nobtained from a stratum lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I might not have learned much,\Nbut there's no harm in keeping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your transformation time for today\Nis about to exceed two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.62,0:05:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please revert to your\Noriginal vending machine form.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.70,0:05:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need to turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea there was a time limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.36,0:05:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, I've got less\Nthan 20,000 points left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better cool it with the transformations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.82,0:05:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weather is beautiful again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.26,0:05:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a single person has come by since\Nthen, but that doesn't bother me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to these babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I decided to unlock the\Nsolar panel function.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now I can save up points\Nwhenever the sun's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't even have to lift a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is bask in the sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.30,0:06:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.37,0:06:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They kind of look like little bears.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're being chased.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.56,0:06:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave us alone, you big bullies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.30,0:06:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, we won't leave you behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of them's injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.56,0:06:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.32,0:06:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here they come. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.06,0:06:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like that worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.12,0:07:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.48,0:07:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope those adorable bear\Ncats made it out safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.68,0:07:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, they stopped chasing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird. They were hot on our tails.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way they'd\Njust give up like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.92,0:07:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.83,0:07:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The little guys came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did this big Boxxo thing come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think it was here when we\Npassed by this spot earlier. Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.54,0:07:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is pure bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.74,0:07:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like nothing more than to sit here and\Nbe surrounded by these Goddess all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.86,0:07:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have to figure out what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.74,0:07:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pink and Pink!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have expected that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I lose these Bearcats now, who knows\Nhow long it'll be till someone else comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.16,0:08:01.87,sign_22108_255_Men_s_Underwear,text (top row; left to right),0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H949DEE&\fs8}Fried chicken\NHamburger combo\NImagawayaki
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.16,0:08:01.87,sign_22108_255_Men_s_Underwear,text (top row; left to right),0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H949DEE&\fs8\pos(110,20)}Grilled rice balls\NHot dog\NYakisoba
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.16,0:08:01.87,sign_22108_255_Men_s_Underwear,text (top row; left to right),0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H949DEE&\fs8\pos(180,20)}Pasta with cream sauce\NFrench fries\NTakoyaki
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.22,0:07:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks different all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.96,0:08:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, maybe we should just leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.56,0:08:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kind of smells like meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.32,0:08:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a picture of meat on the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.76,0:08:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this thing sells food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.18,0:08:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I don't trust it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.90,0:08:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This could be a trap using food as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.90,0:08:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pell, don't go near it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stay strong, short resistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.26,0:08:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it smells delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.99,0:08:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I've figured out\Neveryone's names now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.46,0:08:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bearcat who's in charge is Mikenne.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one with the droopy ears is Suco.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chubby guy is called Pell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.52,0:08:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the darker-furred one is Short.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.24,0:08:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to try one bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.88,0:08:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry, I can't think straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.52,0:08:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, have some self-control, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.66,0:09:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're one of the pouched bearcat fiends,\Na proud member of the Devouring Devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.20,0:09:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devouring Devils, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.22,0:09:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew these guys\Nreminded me of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.64,0:09:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're Tasmanian Devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.66,0:09:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I recall, they're carnivores\Nthat have quite the appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.06,0:09:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was so tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.24,0:09:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'm going to eat one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This must be where food comes\Nout if you feed it coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.82,0:09:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't fall for it, Suco short!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.74,0:09:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This tastes incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.56,0:09:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to try one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.10,0:09:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, it's so yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay, time for seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.58,0:09:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you have done if this\Nwas all part of an elaborate trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.70,0:09:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, as the leader, I should at least\Nmake sure none of it is poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.60,0:09:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that meat's so\Njuicy, it's overflowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.64,0:09:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has got to be the best thing\NI've ever eaten in my entire life!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.80,0:09:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They never stood a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.24,0:09:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on what little information I've\Noverheard, these bearcats are hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.16,0:10:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and their group is called\Nthe Voracious Devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.26,0:10:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for some reason, their\Nexpenses are incredibly high?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.06,0:10:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is why they've come to this stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.62,0:10:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in hopes of earning a\Nbunch of money quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.06,0:10:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, judging from\Nwhat I just saw them do,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.14,0:10:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a feeling I know why\Ntheir overhead is so high.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.52,0:10:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, guys, now that\Nwe've filled our bellies,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should find our way\Nback to the maze's entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.08,0:10:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, maybe we should back up and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's super scary here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.28,0:10:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.22,0:10:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we haven't found any treasure yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.14,0:10:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like we're\Ngoing back empty-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.16,0:10:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That definitely counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.88,0:10:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I don't mind being called a\Ntreasure, I'm nobody's property.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.56,0:10:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, I already have Lamas as my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.86,0:10:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That scared the crap out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.78,0:10:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot this\Nweird box thing could speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.84,0:10:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.72,0:10:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.32,0:10:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.98,0:11:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.50,0:11:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like it was\Nreacting to our voices just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure it's not a coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but the timing made\Nit sound like a response.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.70,0:11:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.88,0:11:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.42,0:11:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a distinct\Npossibility that it's sentient
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.02,0:11:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and can understand\Neverything we're saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.72,0:11:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.63,0:11:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I've been waiting for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.72,0:11:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.92,0:11:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that proves it\Ndoesn't understand us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.80,0:11:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It keeps on responding with nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, think it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.24,0:11:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only say canned phrases,\Nand I have to make do with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.42,0:11:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.33,0:11:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.25,0:11:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing only says stuff\Nwhenever we talk first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.58,0:11:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.49,0:11:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why I expected more from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.62,0:11:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's not that complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.58,0:11:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your brains a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.36,0:11:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though this magic\Nitem is dumb as rocks,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.68,0:11:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we should still\Nbring it back with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.85,0:11:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least they're taking\Nme to the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.52,0:11:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should sit back since\Nyou're injured, Suco.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.82,0:11:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to the three of\Nus to carry this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.62,0:12:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.22,0:12:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could turn into cardboard\Nto make this easier,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.64,0:12:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but suddenly transforming\Nmight scare them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.60,0:12:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, it feels so much lighter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, there are wheels on the\Nbottom of the box to help it move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.38,0:12:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.34,0:12:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were these here the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.62,0:12:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heave, ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is way easier. Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can eat any time\Nwe're hungry. No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a special magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we sell it to a place\Nlike Chains Restaurant,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.92,0:12:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet we could make a huge fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.74,0:12:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.98,0:12:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, sure, you're so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.52,0:12:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to rain on your parade,\Nbut I'm definitely not for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.70,0:12:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, Chains Restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.22,0:12:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather be in that\Ncrocodile than with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.26,0:12:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're getting close to the spot where\Nthose huge hog fiends first showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.18,0:12:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When they sprung out from\Nthat fork without any warning,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.94,0:12:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so surprised I got hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.94,0:12:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be best if I'd let\Nthem know about my barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.36,0:13:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like some kind of wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.06,0:13:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.44,0:13:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too strong, we can't get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help us, Beacon Ake! Suco! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.22,0:13:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this your doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, short!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.24,0:13:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.15,0:13:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling this\Nwas too good to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.76,0:13:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot, I made them wary of me instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.48,0:13:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd better release Pell too\Nin order to clear this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.56,0:13:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it spit me out. Pell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.08,0:13:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would the magic item\Nput us outside on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.80,0:13:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.18,0:13:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it changed again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you messing with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough with the hello there crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.40,0:13:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.31,0:13:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll have to come up with some
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.23,0:13:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,other way of trying to\Ncommunicate with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll use that\Nfunction I saw earlier.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.80,0:13:53.43,sign_22108_255_Men_s_Underwear,text,0,0,0,,{\c&HCDE0E9&\3c&HB7B3AB&}Hello there. Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.30,0:13:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.64,0:14:00.73,sign_22108_255_Men_s_Underwear,text,0,0,0,,{\c&HBDFFFA&\3c&H191C1A&}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:14:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a whole bunch of funny\Npictures moving in a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only things I could put on\Nmy board are my normal messages?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.58,0:14:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're letters or something, but\NI've never seen anything like them before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.14,0:14:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.34,0:14:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.44,0:14:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all in Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.14,0:14:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based off everything\Nthat's happened so far,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.32,0:14:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seems obvious to me\Nthat it's rejecting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.74,0:14:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.66,0:14:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad, it says. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.44,0:14:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.42,0:14:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.86,0:14:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so frustrating!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.98,0:14:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way that\Nsomething that makes food
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.72,0:14:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this delicious could ever\Nbe a bad guy in my book.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.40,0:14:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could eat this every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.86,0:14:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I totally agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.80,0:14:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even remember why we were mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.60,0:14:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all it took?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.10,0:14:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the roar of a huge hog.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.66,0:14:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.38,0:14:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There they are again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.92,0:15:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a kerosene pump, often found\Naround gas stations for winter fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to pull the lever and... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.45,0:15:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to free the nozzle\Nbefore anything will come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.06,0:15:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a good safety feature.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.39,0:15:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what\Nhappened, but I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you get, big dumb jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.95,0:15:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something doesn't seem right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.18,0:15:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.84,0:15:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no this is so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.66,0:15:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The flame skeleton titan
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.20,0:16:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, first a bunch of huge hogs\Nand then the Stratum Lord shows up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.30,0:16:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so scared back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say you get a sweet treasure if you\Nmanage to defeat the Flameskeletitan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how can anyone take down\Na huge monster like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.26,0:16:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to agree with Short.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.66,0:16:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing's probably unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.04,0:16:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in a kind of bad spot right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.34,0:16:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it soothes my heart to watch\Nthem sleeping so peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.74,0:16:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could sit here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.08,0:16:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should probably wake everyone up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.34,0:16:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just give me another\N20 pieces of meat, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, Coin, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.76,0:17:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not something you\Nshould be doing in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.24,0:17:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a room, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.84,0:17:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a weird vibe\Nfrom Zuko's sleep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.36,0:17:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, they're getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.96,0:17:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to summoning you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.74,0:17:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on? So loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.06,0:17:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are flame skulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.78,0:17:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't take them out, they'll\Nsummon the Flame Skeletitan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.90,0:17:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's their weakness again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.32,0:17:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I totally forgot.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.94,0:17:27.77,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H6E2A10&}Megumi Natural Water
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bottle fell out\Nof the magic item box.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.16,0:17:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.28,0:17:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.79,0:17:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We beat all of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're surprisingly quick on their feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're actually strong after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.26,0:17:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that you'd ever think that\Nfrom their usual demeanor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.08,0:17:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows if we'll be attacked again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.94,0:18:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's each keep a bottle\Nof water at the ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.86,0:18:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.42,0:18:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This magic item is pretty incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.84,0:18:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we were hungry, it gave\Nus a whole bunch of meat,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then it gave us water\Nto put out the flame skulls?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.62,0:18:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,almost as if it had a mind of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.96,0:18:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You make a compelling argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like we're on the brink\Nof coming to an understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.80,0:18:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there! No way! See?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.60,0:18:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All it does is say unrelated\Nrandom catchphrases.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.42,0:18:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time you're getting\Ncold fried chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.70,0:18:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I remember, we should be\Ngetting close to the exit by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.20,0:18:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.14,0:18:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds like there's fighting up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.30,0:18:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can definitely hear\Nthe sounds of a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.80,0:18:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't hear anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got some really sensitive ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds like there's\Na whole bunch of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.59,0:18:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can go and take a quick look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.15,0:18:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch your back out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.16,0:18:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.16,0:19:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on over, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Bear is here with\Na group of adventurers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should meet up with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.70,0:19:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the director doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he was supposed to be\Nstationed on the Clear Flow Lake stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.34,0:19:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Director Bear is here, that\Nmeans I'm saved. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.18,0:19:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of the hunters I saw was\Nincredible. She's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.90,0:19:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.81,0:19:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She kept shouting, Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she crushed a bunch of rock fiends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.12,0:19:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no way a human could\Ntake on a rock fiend per hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.60,0:19:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm pretty sure she said something\Nlike, I can't believe he disappeared again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't feel better until I give him\Na smack for making me so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did the box suddenly get heavier?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo! Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.26,0:19:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.86,0:19:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.96,0:19:59.72,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(95,215)}120 damage\NDurability decreased by 120
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.68,0:20:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you had us all worried sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.96,0:20:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not me, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that when it comes to\Nyou, everything will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They really came down here to look for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.84,0:20:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, for one, am glad to see\Nyou're still in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.46,0:20:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would have been bad\Nif we couldn't find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close call, Shiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No kidding, Aka. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.92,0:20:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.56,0:20:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, when we told Llamas\Nabout how we had to leave you behind...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.02,0:20:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was so angry, she caught\Nup in the captain's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.12,0:20:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows what she would have\Ndone if we hadn't found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.72,0:20:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.10,0:20:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, everything's fine now. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.38,0:20:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas is the reason everyone\Nwas in such a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, long time no see, Director Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.48,0:20:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long time indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.02,0:20:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The band of gluttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only did you find Boxo,\Nyou even kept him safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.68,0:20:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.38,0:20:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great work from the\NMenagerie of Fools, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.16,0:20:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe you all a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.32,0:21:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.70,0:21:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Director, what\Nexactly is this Boxo thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.86,0:21:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, of course, you wouldn't\Nknow him, Mikenne, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.20,0:21:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see the magic item you've\Nbeen protecting is actually named Boxo,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.38,0:21:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he's the beloved resident\Nof the Clearflow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.78,0:21:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this thing just a magic\Nitem that spits out food?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.10,0:21:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a little surprised you\Nguys haven't noticed it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.82,0:21:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo's an intelligent being\Nthat can understand us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.88,0:21:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.52,0:21:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All it says is basic\Nstuff like hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, Boxo can only talk to\Nus by saying a handful of phrases.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.88,0:21:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there means yes, and when\Nhe says too bad, that means no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.14,0:21:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, there's no\Nway that could be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.32,0:21:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, was the stuff we\Nate before fried meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.14,0:21:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.72,0:21:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.90,0:21:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name is short. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.18,0:21:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.09,0:21:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so are you telling me that you completely\Nunderstood everything we were saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.26,0:21:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.68,0:21:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.02,0:22:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.66,0:23:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love the food for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.72,0:23:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like itального했으면.
